Subject: [PATCH] [SW-65638] gaudi2: release: work in progress

After the basic code was set, many changes and adjustments were added
with a big difficulty to split it to many tiny pieces.

Change-Id: Id0e1cea47ce17c1b73934ceaf3c50c59d48920cd
Signed-off-by: Arnon Kaufman <akaufman@habana.ai>

[SW-65638] gaudi2: bits helper

Simplify bits manipulation on a variable. Mainly used
to read registers with bits oriented data. It also helps to
manipulate writing to those registers

Change-Id: I37c8f63d990ab20366335bd0c04bb2ca35f2fffa
Signed-off-by: Arnon Kaufman <akaufman@habana.ai>

[SW-65638] helper: adding list slicing ability

Slice out elements from an array starting from index toward a second
indexed position.
hlp_slice_list <start index> <end index> <elem1> <elem2>...<elemN>

hlp_slice_list 0 3 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9   =>> 1 2 3 4
hlp_slice_list 2 5 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9   =>> 3 4 5 6

Change-Id: I7cdb6084a08ebc1664d7bc34e31ad57be0b5124d
Signed-off-by: Arnon Kaufman <akaufman@habana.ai>

[SW-65638] fwi: enhance the cmdline args handling

The naive parser couldn't prevent unacceptable errors in command
line parsing.
A better approached introduced, and the command and following arguments.
Detected in advance eliminating the wrong shifting in arguments when
mismatch commands are set.

